OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FPlenty of sunny spells through
OL,6,Fthe day with a few showers, these
OL,7,Foccasionally heavy during the
OL,8,Fafternoon before easing later.
OL,9,FNoticeably cooler in a northwesterly
OL,10,Fbreeze.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FA cold but mostly clear
OL,13,Fnight. Cpooler than recent night with
OL,14,Fa frost or mist patches possible in
OL,15,Fprone rural spots.
OL,16,
OL,17,CSaturday:FLong sunny spells with some
OL,18,Fpatchy cloud through the middle of the
OL,19,Fafternoon. Feeling chilly in a light
OL,20,Fnortherly breeze.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
