OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FLong
OL,6,Fsunny spells continue although
OL,7,Fisolated light showers possible
OL,8,FSunday. Frost or fog patches early
OL,9,FMonday, before cloud builds in the
OL,10,Fafternoon. Rain pushing in early
OL,11,FTuesday. Light northerly winds.
